            "review_title": "Review at Gecko Cheap and Cheerful Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Manisha V\n32 contributions\n0\nCheck if discounts apply\nMar 2018 • Couples\nStumbled across this place around 11:15pm that states \"Hanoi's cheapesr and best in Hanoi\". Fancied a pizza. The leaflet sticker stuck on the table said there was a 50% discount on King size pizza. When I asked about the discount, the lady said it didn't apply as it is only up until 9pm. When I asked why they discount now (see picture of leaflet on trip advisor review dated 3 December), they said its stuck on table. At around £7 (200,000 dong) for the pizza and 25,000 song for can of coke, they are not the cheapest. We still predetermined the pizza which had no taste - you had to search hard to see the tomato base sauce. Anyway considering how late it was, it was ok. Anyway when we got the bill by another lady, she has applied the 50% discount. Maybe they applied it because I questioned it or maybe the first lady was trying it on to get full price out of us. Either way, I won't be going there again. By the way, they also had a leaflet on the wall stating king size pizza is 40% off. I think they are enticing tourists in hoping they will accept there is no discount and just pay just like we were going to.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 30, 2018",
